					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="zh" dir="ltr"><table style="width:100%; margin-bottom:0px; border:1px solid #AADDAA; background-color: #E4F2E4; text-align:center;" class="ws-header">

<tbody><tr>
<td class="noprint" style="width:25%; text-align:left; font-size:small;">←<a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%9F%93/%E5%8D%B725&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="戰國策 (士禮居叢書本)/韓/卷25（页面不存在）">魏策四</a>
</td>
<td style="width:50%;"><b>戰國策卷二十六<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>自此卷復有錢本。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small></b>　韓一<br /><span style="color:#999999">作者：</span><a href="/wiki/Author:%E5%8A%89%E5%90%91" title="Author:劉向">劉向</a>　<span style="color:#999999">西漢</span>
</td>
<td class="noprint" style="width:25%; text-align:right; font-size:small;"><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%9F%93/%E5%8D%B727&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="戰國策 (士禮居叢書本)/韓/卷27（页面不存在）">韓策二</a>→
</td></tr></tbody></table>
